WEBVTT

00:01:29.156 --> 00:01:32.036
And he was the wrong guy
for various reasons,

00:01:32.076 --> 00:01:34.316
but my feelings for him

00:01:34.316 --> 00:01:37.516
developed into this crazy obsession,

00:01:37.556 --> 00:01:42.236
the likes of which I have never
experienced before or since, thankfully.

00:01:42.236 --> 00:01:46.556
No matter what I did,
I couldn't escape it.

00:01:46.596 --> 00:01:48.956
Until one day, a friend said to me,

00:01:48.996 --> 00:01:50.676
“You are this hooked

00:01:50.716 --> 00:01:53.676
because he represents
something you're longing for.

00:01:53.716 --> 00:01:57.436
What are you longing for?"

00:01:59.076 --> 00:02:01.316
And the answer came to me
with a sudden clarity.